06:16:54  == Your files
06:16:54  ClaudeOS can't open macOS's own files: on this Mac they're always encrypted, with keys only macOS can use
06:16:54  (FileVault or not). So setup copies the folders you choose onto a drive called ClaudeOS that both systems open;
06:16:54  macOS keeps its own copies. What you save on that drive in ClaudeOS is in macOS too, and you can send more
06:16:54  later (run setup again).
06:16:54  macOS may ask whether Terminal can open your Desktop, Documents and Downloads folders: choose OK.
